{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ewvjdu","slideIndex":1,"text":"The challenge provides synthetic Toronto-style transaction data. We tested the model with six walk-forward monthly windows, for 10,069 homes per track overall. In each window, we trained on sales before the month and predicted sales in that month. We did not use hidden sale prices or outside records.\n\nSource: Official starter README and handout: https://github.com/erwinzhang7/SSU-Data-Dash and https://github.com/erwinzhang7/SSU-Data-Dash/blob/main/handout.md"}
