{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/kl9v7q","slideIndex":5,"text":"Our results are useful within this synthetic benchmark, but the community names and coordinates do not map to real Toronto. The hidden period may behave differently from the six validation months, and home-level bootstrap intervals do not capture shared month shocks. The organizer says remarks reflect market dynamics, so we tested them separately. After correcting the paired MdAPE calculation, both confirmation-period intervals include zero. We therefore kept the published structured model frozen and retained the remarks predictions as an experiment. A next step is to test price-tail calibration with the same forward-only validation. Thank you.\n\nSource: Official handout: https://github.com/erwinzhang7/SSU-Data-Dash/blob/main/handout.md. Organizer reply on remarks: https://discord.com/channels/1536459393493762058/1558195702700441700/1558522942113980459. Corrected analysis: experiments/remarks_experiment_audit.json."}